        "paramDescription": "Append one line to the Task's existing description. NEVER replace or drop existing lines.\n\nStart from target_existing_description (from \"create the necessary inputs for the email\").\nIt may be empty. Output it verbatim, then a newline, then this new line:\n\n[<today YYYY-MM-DD>] invoice <invoice_number>, stage <reminder_count>, Zendesk #<zendesk_ticket_id>\n\nUse the real Zendesk ticket id created in the Create Ticket step. If\ntarget_existing_description is empty, output only the new line with no leading newline.\n\nSibling invoices at the same stage land on the same Task, so this field accumulates one\nline per outreach.",
